# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the GTK tray checks of run-wizard-checks.sh.
# Only third-party caches that live until process exit: the fontconfig pattern
# cache filled by pango while GTK measures labels, and the GVariant of GTK's
# screensaver portal signal. The tray code itself never calls fontconfig.
leak:libfontconfig.so
leak:screensaver_signal_portal
# The 64-byte parameter tuple of that same portal signal: GTK keeps the parsed
# message body; its stack ends in GIO's D-Bus reader without a GTK frame. The
# WP09 fallback check (run-tray-checks.sh) shows the identical leak.
leak:g_dbus_message_new_from_blob
